{%- comment -%}
  PG R36S Title: centre the product title and the rating line on phones, so the
  R36S page reads like the orb page.

  pg-orb-title does this for the orb; the same two rules are all the R36S needs,
  because it already has pg-landing's own size and weight there (34px / 600) —
  only the alignment differed. .pgx-rating is a flex row, so it is centred with
  justify-content rather than text-align.

  Phones only, matching the orb: on desktop the buy column sits beside the
  gallery in a two-column grid, where a centred heading lines up with nothing
  below it.

  Kept out of pg-r36s-mobile for the same reason pg-orb-title is kept out of
  pg-tiktok-pdp: that file owns the page's layout and gallery behaviour, this is
  typography. Registered in templates/product.pg-landing.json only.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  @media (max-width:900px){
    html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-title{text-align:center !important}
    html body #pgx .pgx-buy > .pgx-rating{
      justify-content:center !important;
      text-align:center !important;
    }
  }
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name": "PG R36S Title", "settings": [], "presets": [{"name": "PG R36S Title"}]}
{% endschema %}
